   "design": "Replies to prospective students start from drafts citing the programme's approved pages, and the teacher edits each, checks it against the question and sends it once. Admissions system views replace applicant spreadsheets and show registration status as a list. Placement agreements fill student and host details from the records. Open days, conversations, reviewing applications, interviews, registration help, host mail, checking and sending stay with the teacher. No model assesses applicants.",
